IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SHEN-AMX.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-M               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DIM-K               PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 DIM-N               PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SHEN-AMX.
    IF DIM-M == 0 OR DIM-K == 0 OR DIM-N == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 2280 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 DIM-M.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
